# fixedbugs, defect 2288, 2026-11-07: a record of 2,048 fields of two C
# spellings in turn, an `i64` and a record of one byte, each built in the
# same construction: every label found through the record's names, and the
# prologue's hidden temporaries of each spelling sharing one declaration
# (defect 2050), both near the square of the fields before: 4.89 billion
# instructions of its own, 3.98 since. Each field holds its own value.

